[en.C03_DESC]
According to the final Equestria Empire feudal plan, the area around Cloudsdale will elect a leader and accept the enfeoffment of Empress Cozy Glow as the Duchess to rule these areas. Unlike the general election in Ponyville and the surrounding areas, the Cloudsdale and the surrounding areas adopt a representative election system. The election in Cloudsdale can be described as a farce: various forces are constantly arguing, and the voting process is full of loopholes.\n\nIn the end, the election result of Cloudsdale was inexplicably elected by a mailpony, Derpy Hooves, from Ponyville. As for Derpy, she didn’t quite understand what happened. It seemed that it’s just a few more tasks added to her mail delivery job: promulgating a few laws, or going to Canterlot for a meeting, that’s all. But Derpy is very happy, she only knows that she can get as many muffins as she wants now... probably?

[en.PIHC_WS_C03_desc]
According to the final Equestria Empire feudal plan, the area around Cloudsdale will elect a leader and accept the enfeoffment of Empress Cozy Glow as the Duchess to rule these areas. Unlike the general election in Ponyville and the surrounding areas, the Cloudsdale and the surrounding areas adopt a representative election system. The election in Cloudsdale can be described as a farce: various forces are constantly arguing, and the voting process is full of loopholes.\nThe interesting story of the first Cloudsdale election must start with the Stratusburg.\n\nIn the early election plan, Stratusburg was also part of these areas, but under the interference of the “Free Stratusburg Movement”, the election could not proceed normally. Almost all the election representatives from the Stratusburg area were supporters of the “Free Stratusburg Movement”, including the leader of the movement, Spitfire, who also appeared at the election site. A large number of members of the “Free Stratusburg Movement” firmly voted for the leader Spitfire and opposed all other high-vote candidates. Therefore, in the first thirty-three rounds of voting, no candidate received enough votes to be elected.\n\nAt this time, the Empire had to compromise with the “Free Stratusburg Movement” and allowed Stratusburg to hold elections separately from the Cloudsdale and the surrounding areas. However, during this negotiation process, the voting was still in progress. The members of the “Free Stratusburg Movement” who were expelled from the voting site and were prohibited from voting for Spitfire held a large-scale protest at the election site, disrupted the vote counting process, and forcibly broke into the venue to vote for other candidates not recommended by the Equestria Empire. After the thirty-ninth round of voting, representatives from other areas were exhausted, and the members of the “Free Stratusburg Movement” still refused to recognize any candidates with a high willingness to cooperate with the Empire.\n\nJust as the Empire was losing patience and preparing to intervene with force, the innocent mailpony Derpy Hooves passed by the election site. A representative from Cloudsdale said angrily, “If we don’t get somepony elected soon, then neither side should get to elect anyone! Why don’t we just pick somepony at random... Look... let Derpy be the Duchess!”\nAt this time, the angry members of the “Free Stratusburg Movement” also shouted, “Alright! You believe it or not, if you dare to pick at random, we dare to pass it!”\nIn this way, in the puzzled expressions of representatives from other areas, the two sides that were originally at odds: the Cloudsdale area that obeyed the Equestria Empire, and the Stratusburg area that opposed the Equestria Empire, actually voted for the same candidate — Derpy Hooves, in the fortieth round of voting.\nAfter two more rounds of voting, Derpy Hooves was elected with just enough votes in the forty-second round of voting. After the election committee reviewed the election rules, it was confirmed that even though Derpy Hooves was a resident of Ponyville, she could become the Duchess of Cloudsdale and the surrounding areas because she was a pegasus. Derpy Hooves, who was fooled into participating in the election by a fake promise of free muffins, naturally had no objections.\n\nThe “Free Stratusburg Movement”, the Cloudsdale area, and the Equestria Empire all regarded this election as a victory, believing that their opposition did not get the results they wanted. But... whatever, why bother? Let’s have a muffin, sit down and have a nice chat.\n\nIn the end, the election result of Cloudsdale was inexplicably elected by a mailpony, Derpy Hooves, from Ponyville. As for Derpy, she didn’t quite understand what happened. It seemed that it’s just a few more tasks added to her mail delivery job: promulgating a few laws, or going to Canterlot for a meeting, that’s all. But Derpy is very happy, she only knows that she can get as many muffins as she wants now... probably?

